Oklahoma QSO Party -- the 77 Oklahoma counties, each its own multiplier.
Three-letter codes from the sponsor's county table (k5cm.com/counties_files/counties-x.htm), fetched 2026-10-26.
No county maps to the state: the rules count The 77 Oklahoma counties as multipliers of their own for every entrant.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

